---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import chapterGroupImage from '../assets/gallery/gallery1.JPG';
---

<Layout title="About Us - FBLA Chapter" description="Learn about our FBLA chapter's mission, values, and what we stand for in business education and leadership development">
	<section class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>About Our Chapter</h1>
			<p>Empowering tomorrow's business leaders today</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mission-vision">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="mission-grid">
				<div class="mission-card">
					<div class="card-icon">
						<svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z" fill="#3b82f6"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h2>Our Mission</h2>
					<p>To inspire and prepare students to become community-minded business leaders in a global society through relevant career preparation and leadership experiences.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="mission-card">
					<div class="card-icon">
						<svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z" fill="#10b981"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h2>Our Vision</h2>
					<p>To be the premier student business organization that develops competent, aggressive business leaders who are prepared for successful careers in business and entrepreneurship.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="mission-card">
					<div class="card-icon">
						<svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M16 6l2.29 2.29-4.88 4.88-4-4L2 16.59 3.41 18l6-6 4 4 6.3-6.29L22 12V6z" fill="#f59e0b"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h2>Our Values</h2>
					<p>Integrity, innovation, excellence, and service guide everything we do. We believe in developing ethical leaders who make a positive impact in their communities.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="chapter-story">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="story-content">
				<div class="story-text">
					<h2>Our Chapter Story</h2>
					<p>Founded in 2010, the Central High School FBLA chapter has grown from a small group of 15 ambitious students to one of the most active and successful chapters in our state, with over 120 members.</p>
					
					<p>Our chapter has consistently demonstrated excellence in competitive events, community service, and leadership development. We've sent delegates to the National Leadership Conference for eight consecutive years and have won numerous state-level awards.</p>
					
					<p>What sets our chapter apart is our commitment to real-world application of business principles. Through partnerships with local businesses, internship programs, and entrepreneurship initiatives, our members gain practical experience that prepares them for success in college and their careers.</p>
					
					<div class="story-stats">
						<div class="stat">
							<div class="stat-number">120+</div>
							<div class="stat-label">Active Members</div>
						</div>
						<div class="stat">
							<div class="stat-number">8</div>
							<div class="stat-label">Years at Nationals</div>
						</div>
						<div class="stat">
							<div class="stat-number">25+</div>
							<div class="stat-label">State Awards</div>
						</div>
						<div class="stat">
							<div class="stat-number">$50K+</div>
							<div class="stat-label">Scholarships Earned</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="story-image">
					<Image src={chapterGroupImage} alt="FBLA Chapter Group Photo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
					<div class="image-caption">
						<p>Our 2024 chapter members at the State Leadership Conference</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="what-we-do">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>What We Do</h2>
			<div class="activities-grid">
				<div class="activity-card">
					<div class="activity-icon">
						<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zM9 17H7v-7h2v7zm4 0h-2V7h2v10zm4 0h-2v-4h2v4z" fill="#3b82f6"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3>Competitive Events</h3>
					<p>Participate in over 70 business-related competitive events at regional, state, and national levels. From accounting to entrepreneurship, find your passion and excel.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="activity-card">
					<div class="activity-icon">
						<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z" fill="#10b981"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3>Leadership Development</h3>
					<p>Build essential leadership skills through officer positions, committee work, and mentorship programs that prepare you for future success.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="activity-card">
					<div class="activity-icon">
						<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z" fill="#f59e0b"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3>Community Service</h3>
					<p>Give back to our community through various service projects, fundraisers, and partnerships with local nonprofits and businesses.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="activity-card">
					<div class="activity-icon">
						<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M20 6h-2.18c.11-.31.18-.65.18-1a2.996 2.996 0 0 0-5.5-1.65l-.5.67-.5-.68C10.96 2.54 10.05 2 9 2 7.34 2 6 3.34 6 5c0 .35.07.69.18 1H4c-1.11 0-1.99.89-1.99 2L2 19c0 1.11.89 2 2 2h16c1.11 0 2-.89 2-2V8c0-1.11-.89-2-2-2zm-5-2c.55 0 1 .45 1 1s-.45 1-1 1-1-.45-1-1 .45-1 1-1zM9 4c.55 0 1 .45 1 1s-.45 1-1 1-1-.45-1-1 .45-1 1-1z" fill="#ef4444"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3>Networking</h3>
					<p>Connect with business professionals, alumni, and peers through conferences, guest speakers, and industry events that open doors to opportunities.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="activity-card">
					<div class="activity-icon">
						<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z" fill="#8b5cf6"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3>Professional Development</h3>
					<p>Attend workshops, seminars, and conferences that enhance your business knowledge and prepare you for college and career success.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="activity-card">
					<div class="activity-icon">
						<svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
							<path d="M9 11H7v6h2v-6zm4 0h-2v6h2v-6zm4 0h-2v6h2v-6zm2.5-9H19V1h-2v1H7V1H5v1H3.5C2.67 2 2 2.67 2 3.5v16C2 20.33 2.67 21 3.5 21h17c.83 0 1.5-.67 1.5-1.5v-16C22 2.67 21.33 2 20.5 2z" fill="#06b6d4"/>
						</svg>
					</div>
					<h3>Entrepreneurship</h3>
					<p>Develop and pitch business ideas through our entrepreneurship program, with opportunities to compete and receive mentorship from local business owners.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="join-us">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="join-content">
				<h2>Ready to Join Us?</h2>
				<p>Become part of a community that's dedicated to developing the next generation of business leaders. Whether you're interested in entrepreneurship, marketing, finance, or any other business field, FBLA provides the platform to explore, learn, and excel.</p>
				
				<div class="join-benefits">
					<div class="benefit">
						<h4>🏆 Competitive Excellence</h4>
						<p>Compete in business events and showcase your skills on state and national stages</p>
					</div>
					<div class="benefit">
						<h4>💼 Career Preparation</h4>
						<p>Gain practical business experience through internships and industry partnerships</p>
					</div>
					<div class="benefit">
						<h4>🎓 Scholarship Opportunities</h4>
						<p>Access exclusive scholarships and recognition programs for FBLA members</p>
					</div>
					<div class="benefit">
						<h4>🤝 Lifelong Connections</h4>
						<p>Build relationships with peers, mentors, and business professionals</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				
				<div class="join-actions">
					<a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Contact Us Today</a>
					<a href="/officer-team" class="btn btn-secondary">Meet Our Officers</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: calc(92px + 3rem) 0 3rem 0;
		margin-top: 0;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.page-header h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.page-header p {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
	}

	.container {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 2rem;
	}

	.mission-vision {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		background: #f8fafc;
	}

	.mission-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.mission-card {
		background: white;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
		text-align: center;
		transition: transform 0.3s;
	}

	.mission-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
	}

	.card-icon {
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.mission-card h2 {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: #1e3a8a;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.mission-card p {
		color: #4b5563;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.chapter-story {
		padding: 4rem 0;
	}

	.story-content {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.story-text h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: #1e3a8a;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.story-text p {
		color: #4b5563;
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 1.1rem;
	}

	.story-stats {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.stat {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 1rem;
		background: #f8fafc;
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.stat-number {
		font-size: 2rem;
		font-weight: bold;
		color: #3b82f6;
	}

	.stat-label {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: #6b7280;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
	}

	.story-image {
		text-align: center;
	}

	.story-image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 300px;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 12px;
		box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
	}

	.image-caption {
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.image-caption p {
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: #6b7280;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.what-we-do {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		background: #f8fafc;
	}

	.what-we-do h2 {
		text-align: center;
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: #1e3a8a;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.activities-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.activity-card {
		background: white;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
		transition: transform 0.3s;
	}

	.activity-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
	}

	.activity-icon {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.activity-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		color: #1e3a8a;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.activity-card p {
		color: #4b5563;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.join-us {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #3b82f6 100%);
		color: white;
	}

	.join-content {
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.join-content h2 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.join-content > p {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.join-benefits {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.benefit {
		text-align: left;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
		border-radius: 8px;
	}

	.benefit h4 {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.benefit p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		opacity: 0.9;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.join-actions {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.btn {
		padding: 0.75rem 2rem;
		border-radius: 6px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: all 0.3s;
		display: inline-block;
	}

	.btn-primary {
		background: white;
		color: #1e3a8a;
	}

	.btn-primary:hover {
		background: #f8fafc;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.btn-secondary {
		background: transparent;
		color: white;
		border: 2px solid white;
	}

	.btn-secondary:hover {
		background: white;
		color: #1e3a8a;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.page-header h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.story-content {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}

		.story-stats {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		}

		.join-actions {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: center;
		}
	}
</style>
